    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d734">

                <pb facs="0664" n="548" xml:id="pg548"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No 838.001 Au 4/2.]</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            American Minister to Haiti</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-10-28">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 28, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I enclose; with office copy, a letter
                    addressed by the President to His Excellency Tancrède Auguste, acknowledging his
                    letter of August 19 last in which he announced his election, on the 8th of that
                    month, to the Presidency of the Republic of Haiti and his entrance upon the
                    duties of that office.</p>
                <p>You will forward the copy to the Foreign Office and deliver the original in the
                    manner most agreeable to His Excellency.</p>
                <p>I am [etc]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">P. C. Knox.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d734-a1.xml" xpointer="d734-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d734-a2.xml" xpointer="d734-a2"/>
